{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8b5132f5b3f91403e4a24a9e865a1bfd.avif?t=1773985255\" width=1280 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GunX: Build Fast. Shoot Faster. Survive the Impossible</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GunX is a fast-paced VR shooter built around <strong>precision gun assembly</strong>, high-pressure combat, and intense multiplayer duels. Every fight begins with gun parts and your ability to put a weapon together before anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.poster.avif?t=1773985255\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.webm?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.mp4?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap parts into place, rack the slide, load your magazine, and unleash chaos in <strong>PvP</strong>, <strong>Zombie campaign</strong>, or master the weapon in\u00a0<strong>Shooting Range</strong>. Whether you\u2019re battling players across the world or fighting back-to-back with a friend against waves of the undead, GunX keeps your adrenaline spiking from the moment you enter the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online PvP (Duels)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.poster.avif?t=1773985255\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.webm?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.mp4?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round begins with a <i>random weapon</i> that both players must assemble from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fast, load up, and eliminate your opponent to score points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of bullets? That mistake might cost you the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First player to win <strong>best of 3 rounds</strong> claims victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombie Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.poster.avif?t=1773985255\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.webm?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.mp4?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against relentless waves of zombies in an action-packed campaign.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic weapons and gradually unlock stronger guns and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow wilder, faster, and deadlier as the campaign progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special tools like <strong>Molotovs</strong>, <strong>Pipe Bombs</strong>, and <strong>Shields</strong> to control the chaos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Op\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/c968125e924f2ba622c5d3ed0ab031b5.poster.avif?t=1773985255\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/c968125e924f2ba622c5d3ed0ab031b5.webm?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/c968125e924f2ba622c5d3ed0ab031b5.mp4?t=1773985255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the entire Zombie campaign with a friend in 2-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player gets their own assembly desk and resources to manage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With in game voice chat, coordinate, split tasks, cover each other\u2026 and survive together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you will Love GunX</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely <strong>unique VR mechanic</strong>: assemble guns under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, skill-based PvP duels that reward true mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full co-op campaign for unforgettable zombie survival sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A satisfying gameplay loop built on improving speed, precision, and efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth VR interactions with realistic weapon handling and physics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GunX isn\u2019t just another VR shooter \u2014 it\u2019s a <strong>test of skill, speed, and nerves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/567e4cc77b8b2aeac9379e9747f79df9.avif?t=1773985255\" width=1280 height=320 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ash Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/8bd7b9aa01e41408a36ec8318c92cb65ad1e524b.jpg"},{"name":"Burn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/51985db2b28f12dd6ac81eebee7547e36f84c74e.jpg"},{"name":"Technician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/b660da83aed7f13d153d9fe8a04b1ff7120eb05c.jpg"},{"name":"Shielded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/1599646b064e5b5dfb98089ac11a6f093553752d.jpg"},{"name":"Demolitionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/8e6ec74b59f04d89ec2a1b93d745fea7c7a2e38e.jpg"},{"name":"Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/b592f7ab9ea2c71696ee345c2903117370750b90.jpg"},{"name":"Economist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/814e062a11592ec332160a5b56cf6c670b921d6e.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/3208784e9a01f114fae415c19ead81c952a3ec24.jpg"},{"name":"War Economy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/20dfcfe1e73ef262d18b4bbe71e7288a08ebd5e3.jpg"},{"name":"Cash Magnet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3424760/662e9cc0f484c546174cbc6f33a297b2042280d4.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424760?t=1773985255","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/page_