ate, split tasks, cover each other\u2026 and survive together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you will Love GunX</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely <strong>unique VR mechanic</strong>: assemble guns under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, skill-based PvP duels that reward true mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full co-op campaign for unforgettable zombie survival sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A satisfying gameplay loop built on improving speed, precision, and efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth VR interactions with realistic weapon handling and physics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GunX isn\u2019t just another VR shooter \u2014 it\u2019s a <strong>test of skill, speed, and nerves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/567e4cc77b8b2aeac9379e9747f79df9.avif?t=1773985255\" width=1280 height=320 /></span></p>","developers":["Irusu Studios","Irusu Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/3604295569b6b576cfa114727c7429e173a6b520/header.jpg?t=1773985255","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3424760/1962622994/1a2bc818be3cda9bb7197e7a00abf32fea99a19c/1763706899/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763783151","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams